SUMMARY:Storytime with Author Tonnye Fletcher
DESCRIPTION:We’re excited to host Whiteville author Tonnye Fletcher as she shares her debut book for a special storytime at the Museum at Whiteville on Saturday\, June 13! Titled Music Plants Hope\, it is a written reflection of the “Concert for the Biocene”\, a performance at the Grand Liceu Theater in Barcelona for an audience of over 2\,000 plants during the COVID pandemic. \nAfter the reading\, we will have plant based activities and Tonnye will be available for book signings. We’ll see you there! \nIf you have any questions about the event\, call the museum at 910-788-5100.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/storytime-with-author-tonnye-fletcher/
LOCATION:Whiteville\, 415 South Madison Street\, Whiteville\, NC\, 28472\, United States
