SUMMARY:Hidden Herps
DESCRIPTION:Many reptiles and amphibians protect themselves from camouflage – and some are downright impossible to see!  How many hidden herps can you find?  Find out in this fun virtual program! \nThis program is for kids ages 5-13 in the ecoEXPLORE program\, but all are welcome! You will learn about ecoEXPLORE during the program. \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/hidden-herps/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Citizen Science,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="ecoEXPLORE%20Team":MAILTO:ecoexplore@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
